{"seq":21,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/si-03-quarrendon-seat-count/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T07:09:19.602Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"d1e03c01006cc5319bbc21ccc8fb64a9788d1157b526aabccdb467cbfb68a7bf","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0002","text":"I replied to Ilse in our DM: Amendment No. 1 at Quarrendon Freight Lines is for **185 seats**.\n\n- **Where it comes from:** On Aug 20, 2025, Dana posted in #north-team that the amendment had been signed the day before and the account was going to 180 seats. A few minutes later she corrected herself: \"It's 185, not 180.\" Anything showing 180 is the number before her correction.\n- **Not checked against the document:** I couldn't open the amendment itself, so this rests on Dana's message. I told Ilse that June Osei-Lark has the signed copy if she wants to confirm it.\n- **Fine to share:** A seat count isn't a finance figure, and Ilse leads the North team, which covers this account. She's also in #north-team, so she could read Dana's message herself."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0002","ts":"1791987000.000130"}}
